-- Migration 64 DOWN: no-op.
--
-- Migration 64 is a data backfill (NONE -> sensible default) on existing
-- `source` rows. There is no faithful inverse — re-setting `private` to NONE
-- would re-break the strict `TYPE bool` schema (and the original NONEs were
-- drift, not intent). Mirrors 61_down. Down intentionally does nothing; the
-- data stays valid.
